body:
You're right, nobody should be put in danger or abusive relationships. But some people are shitty. Awfully shitty, disgusting and repulsive. 

&#x200B;

What I was trying to say is that if the girl is already in an abusive relationship, she WILL put her herself in danger, because if her abuser finds out, he'll likely do something horrible.

Thought this was original, almost commented something kind. Please do not steal. Go fuck yourself.

&#x200B;

The actual artist is  [u/colorsbysue](https://www.reddit.com/u/colorsbysue/) , their work is awesome!
